      "content": "it's not about my passwords or accounts being hacked... i know i'm logged in. i mean it's more like the way the \"me\" online is actually behaving. like, i saw a message from my sister saying i said something yesterday that i never would have said, but it used my exact slang and my exact humor. it was perfect. if an ai was trained on my data, wouldn't it be able to mimic my personality flawlessly? how would i even know if i'm talking to a person or a model that's just been fed every text and email i've ever sent?",
